  "basicText": {
    "title": "基本课文",
    "basicSentences": [
      {
        "id": "l35-basic-s001",
        "order": 1,
        "text": "明日雨が降ったら、マラソン大会は中止です。",
        "translationZh": "如果明天下雨，马拉松大会就取消。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "1. 明日雨が降ったら、マラソン大会は中止です。",
        "audioSegment": {
          "id": "l35-basic-s001",
          "trackId": "lesson_basic",
          "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson35/l35-basic-s001.mp3",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 4.14,
          "duration": 4.14,
          "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
          "confidence": "approved",
          "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:16:04.790Z",
          "sourceAudioSha256": "f83ce440fb00967bf61b1d8ef4dff56ca300c8c9f079e500afaba22ce912ece9"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "l35-basic-s002",
        "order": 2,
        "text": "日本へ帰っても、中国語の勉強を続けてください。",
        "translationZh": "即使回到日本，也请继续学习汉语。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "2. 日本へ帰っても、中国語の勉強を続けてください。",
        "audioSegment": {
          "id": "l35-basic-s002",
          "trackId": "lesson_basic",
          "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson35/l35-basic-s002.mp3",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 5.06,
          "duration": 5.06,
          "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
          "confidence": "approved",
          "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:16:04.790Z",
          "sourceAudioSha256": "f83ce440fb00967bf61b1d8ef4dff56ca300c8c9f079e500afaba22ce912ece9"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "l35-basic-s003",
        "order": 3,
        "text": "今年の夏休みは３日だけです。",
        "translationZh": "今年暑假只有三天。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "3. 今年の夏休みは３日だけです。",
        "audioSegment": {
          "id": "l35-basic-s003",
          "trackId": "lesson_basic",
          "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson35/l35-basic-s003.mp3",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 2.78,
          "duration": 2.78,
          "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
          "confidence": "approved",
          "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:16:04.790Z",
          "sourceAudioSha256": "f83ce440fb00967bf61b1d8ef4dff56ca300c8c9f079e500afaba22ce912ece9"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "l35-basic-s004",
        "order": 4,
        "text": "会議室には李さんしかいません。",
        "translationZh": "会议室里只有小李一个人。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "4. 会議室には李さんしかいません。",
        "audioSegment": {
