  "applicationText": {
    "title": "ホームパーティー",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "l35-app-block-001",
        "type": "narration",
        "text": "太田先生和夫人住在天坛公园附近的公寓里。小李、森和小野一起去太田夫妇家拜访，一起包饺子。",
        "translationZh": "太田老师和夫人住在天坛公园附近的公寓里。小李、森和小野一起去拜访太田夫妇，并一起包饺子。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "太田先生和夫人住在天坛公园附近的公寓里。小李、森和小野一起去太田夫妇家拜访，一起包饺子。"
      },
      {
        "id": "l35-app-block-002",
        "type": "scene",
        "text": "小野和太田夫人帮忙打下手，饺子主要由小李来做。小李正在擀饺子皮儿。",
        "translationZh": "小野和太田夫人帮忙打下手，饺子主要由小李来做；小李正在擀饺子皮。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "（小野和太田夫人帮忙打下手，饺子主要由小李来做。小李正在擀饺子皮儿）"
      },
      {
        "id": "l35-app-block-003",
        "type": "dialogue",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l35-app-block-003-line-001",
            "speaker": "李",
            "text": "あのう、お酒があったら、少し入れてくれませんか。",
            "translationZh": "那个，如果有酒，能放一点吗？",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "李：あのう、お酒があったら、少し入れてくれませんか。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l35-app-block-003-line-001",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson35/l35-app-block-003-line-001.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 16.06,
              "duration": 16.06,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:16:51.185Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "82f57b8c24e4d8c8e7c1231c6c1c2f2f68c8a5a137743657fd4d565183a1bd03"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "l35-app-block-004",
        "type": "scene",
        "text": "太田夫人倒了一勺绍兴酒。",
        "translationZh": "太田夫人倒了一勺绍兴酒。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "（太田夫人倒了一勺绍兴酒）"
      },
      {
        "id": "l35-app-block-005",
        "type": "dialogue",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l35-app-block-005-line-001",
            "speaker": "夫人",
            "text": "１杯だけでいいですか。",
            "translationZh": "一勺就可以吗？",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "夫人：１杯だけでいいですか。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l35-app-block-005-line-001",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson35/l35-app-block-005-line-001.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 1.9,
              "duration": 1.9,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:16:51.185Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "82f57b8c24e4d8c8e7c1231c6c1c2f2f68c8a5a137743657fd4d565183a1bd03"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l35-app-block-005-line-002",
            "speaker": "李",
            "text": "いいえ、３杯ぐらい入れてください。",
            "translationZh": "不，请放三勺左右。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "李：いいえ、３杯ぐらい入れてください。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l35-app-block-005-line-002",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson35/l35-app-block-005-line-002.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 2.18,
              "duration": 2.18,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:16:51.185Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "82f57b8c24e4d8c8e7c1231c6c1c2f2f68c8a5a137743657fd4d565183a1bd03"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l35-app-block-005-line-003",
            "speaker": "夫人",
            "text": "李さん、餃子を作るのが上手ですね。",
            "translationZh": "小李，你很会包饺子啊。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "夫人：李さん、餃子を作るのが上手ですね。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l35-app-block-005-line-003",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson35/l35-app-block-005-line-003.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 3.82,
              "duration": 3.82,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:16:51.185Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "82f57b8c24e4d8c8e7c1231c6c1c2f2f68c8a5a137743657fd4d565183a1bd03"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l35-app-block-005-line-004",
            "speaker": "李",
            "text": "ええ。北京では、餃子はどの家でも、自分たちで作って食べます。小さな子供も上手ですよ。",
            "translationZh": "是的。在北京，家家都自己包饺子吃。小孩子也很会包。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "李：ええ。北京では、餃子はどの家でも、自分たちで作って食べます。小さな子供も上手ですよ。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l35-app-block-005-line-004",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson35/l35-app-block-005-line-004.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 7.31,
              "duration": 7.31,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:16:51.185Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "82f57b8c24e4d8c8e7c1231c6c1c2f2f68c8a5a137743657fd4d565183a1bd03"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l35-app-block-005-line-005",
            "speaker": "夫人",
            "text": "わたし、本のとおりに作っても、なかなかうまくできないんですが、どうやったらおいしくなるんでしょうか。",
            "translationZh": "我即使照着书做，也总是做不好，怎样做才会好吃呢？",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "夫人：わたし、本のとおりに作っても、なかなかうまくできないんですが、どうやったらおいしくなるんでしょうか。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l35-app-block-005-line-005",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson35/l35-app-block-005-line-005.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 5.82,
              "duration": 5.82,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:16:51.185Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "82f57b8c24e4d8c8e7c1231c6c1c2f2f68c8a5a137743657fd4d565183a1bd03"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l35-app-block-005-line-006",
            "speaker": "小野",
            "text": "何度も作ると、だんだん上手になりますよ。",
            "translationZh": "多做几次，就会渐渐做得好了。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "小野：何度も作ると、だんだん上手になりますよ。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l35-app-block-005-line-006",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson35/l35-app-block-005-line-006.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 3.3,
              "duration": 3.3,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:16:51.185Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "82f57b8c24e4d8c8e7c1231c6c1c2f2f68c8a5a137743657fd4d565183a1bd03"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l35-app-block-005-line-007",
            "speaker": "李",
            "text": "もし時間があったら、またいっしょに作りましょう。",
            "translationZh": "如果有时间，我们再一起包吧。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "李：もし時間があったら、またいっしょに作りましょう。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l35-app-block-005-line-007",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson35/l35-app-block-005-line-007.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 3.38,
              "duration": 3.38,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:16:51.185Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "82f57b8c24e4d8c8e7c1231c6c1c2f2f68c8a5a137743657fd4d565183a1bd03"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "l35-app-block-006",
        "type": "scene",
        "text": "不一会儿，饺子做好了。",
        "translationZh": "不一会儿，饺子做好了。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "（不一会儿，饺子做好了）"
      },
      {
        "id": "l35-app-block-007",
        "type": "dialogue",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l35-app-block-007-line-001",
            "speaker": "太田",
            "text": "準備ができたら、乾杯しますよ。",
